<title>USA: Mattel  sets buyback for 6.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Mattel  sets buyback for 6.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mattel Inc said on Wednesday its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to 6.5 million shares of the company's common stock during 1997.</p>
<p>For the year ended December 31 1996, the average number of common and common equivalent shares outstanding totalled 278.4 million.</p>
<p>The board also declared a quarterly dividend of $0.06 per share on its common stock.  The dividend is payable April 3, 1997 to shareholders of record on March 14, 1997.</p>
